<node id="use:VELAYUDHAN2012-T1-COUGH-COLD">
  <data key="d0">traditional_use_report</data>
  <data key="d1">Cough and cold</data>
  <data key="d2">K. C. Velayudhan et al. (2012)</data>
  <data key="d3">VELAYUDHAN2012-T1-COUGH-COLD</data>
  <data key="d4">The article's Table 1 reports half a teaspoonful of fresh turmeric powder mixed with 30 ml of warm milk; it also reports inhalation of smoke from burning dried turmeric rhizome.</data>
  <data key="d5">An India-focused ethnobotany review by authors at NBPGR regional stations; the table says its information was collected from the Malayalam-language book Ayirathionnu Ottamoolikal (Namboodiri, 2004). The article does not assign this particular practice to a named community or precise locality.</data>
  <data key="d6">documented in a secondary ethnobotanical source; not a clinical or experimental efficacy result</data>
</node>
